# Hidden Necropolis: "This land enters tapped", "{T}: Add {B}" and "{4}{B}, {T}, Sacrifice this land: Discover 4. Activate only as a
# sorcery." It enters tapped and untaps with the next turn; it taps for {B} alone (Undo takes it back). The discover is refused when
# five other sources are available but none makes {B} (only blue Mox Sapphires), with a spell on the stack, and outside a main phase;
# once Mox Jet is in play it is paid with exactly {4}{B}. It then exiles from the top of the library past an Island (a land) and Ancient
# Carp (mana value 5, one more than discover 4) and casts Amphin Cutthroat (mana value 4, exactly the limit) for free. The land is
# sacrificed as a cost, so it is in the graveyard when the discover happens, and the two cards skipped go to the bottom of the library
# (CR 701.57a, 602.5d, 118.12).

